{"id":"venom-gland","name":{"en":"Venom Gland","ja":"蛇の毒袋"},"desc":{"en":"A venomous snake's internal organ. Its venom is made here, but there are many other substances inside. As an alchemist, you must handle it often.","ja":"毒蛇の内臓の一つ。主に毒成分が溜め込まれ ているが、それ以外の不純物も色々混じって いる。錬金術士を志すなら、こんなグロい物 も平気な顔で扱わないといけない。"},"level":6,"locations":[{"id":"arland-wastelands","name":{"en":"Arland Wastelands","ja":"アーランド東の荒野"}},{"id":"primordial-island","name":{"en":"Primordial Island","ja":"原初の島"}},{"id":"ancient-monastery","name":{"en":"Ancient Monastery","ja":"古の修道院"},"parent":"northern-ruins"}],"traits":{"id":"dripping-venom","name":{"en":"Dripping Venom","ja":"滴る毒液"}},"categories":[{"id":"healing","name":{"en":"(Healing)","ja":"（薬品）"},"icon":"totori-category-healing"},{"id":"poison","name":{"en":"(Poison)","ja":"（毒の材料）"},"icon":"totori-category-poison"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":76}